{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLTijx4T3M2N57gga7WFcC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Gandalf (full deep-think advisor) â€” Implementation Plan (Crucible Stage 2 â†’ Foreman handoff)\n2\t\n3\ttest-command: node --test test/*.test.mjs\n4\t\n5\t> **v2 (Stage-2 Shark R1: 1 gated BLOCKER + 1 gated MINOR + strong singles).** RESTRUCTURED so EVERY `## Wave N`\n6\t> is autonomously Foreman-gateable by the deterministic `node --test` gate (PRINCIPLE-D). The human-feasibility,\n7\t> advisory-A/B, and external-ledger steps are moved OUT of the autonomous waves into **HALT-gated follow-on\n8\t> increments** (a non-`## Wave` section) â€” they are entered only on explicit human go / external-precondition\n9\t> presence and never carry a non-deterministic done-when. Pre-registration is split: Wave 1 freezes the\n10\t> build-time CONSTANTS (R, firing-threshold, caps); only (G,k) are power-calc-SET in the follow-on feasibility\n11\t> gate. Wave 3 split into SITUATE-compose (W3) + refutation-discipline (W4). See `run/stage2-r1.json`.\n12\t>\n13\t> North Star: `NORTH-STAR.md` (LOCKED). Master Plan: `MASTER-PLAN.md` (Shark-converged). Research substrate:\n14\t> `../research-advisor/FINDINGS.md`. Single-family substrate â†’ cross_model:false; persona = Fable 5.\n15\t\n16\t## Terminal semantics (read FIRST â€” resolves the project-DONE question)\n17\t- **Foreman's AUTONOMOUS project-DONE = Wave 8 GREEN** (all deterministic code: Gandalf v1 at Wave 7 + the\n18\t  elevation-oracle harness CODE at Wave 8). The **committed shippable milestone is Wave 7 (Gandalf v1).**\n19\t- The **HALT-gated follow-on increments H1â€“H3** (below the waves) are NOT autonomous waves: Foreman HALTs for a\n20\t  human go / an external precondition before each, and each terminates in a recorded BLOCKED/UNPROVEN state if\n21\t  its precondition is unmet. No Foreman wave has a non-deterministic or advisory done-when.\n22\t- Reserved/HALT-worthy (Foreman HALTs, neve