{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01YFS8ukHD43RifXSDGqeC4e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a grounded summary of the session, with claims traceable to the two member documents (`MASTER-PLAN.md`, `IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md`) and the locked `NORTH-STAR.md`.\n\n## Gandalf â€” Planning Trio Session Summary (Crucible Stage 1 + 2, post Shark-Tank R1)\n\n**What was planned**\n- Gandalf is scoped as a *deep-think advisor* over any artifact/effort, governed by a North Star locked verbatim by the user on 2026-06-20 and treated as the anti-drift anchor (`NORTH-STAR.md:7-14`).\n- The plan **composes** existing trio machinery rather than rebuilding it: it wires the vetted diagnose core (PROTOCOL v2) + researchPrime, and explicitly does *not* brainstorm (Jumper's job), reimplement researchPrime, or run Crucible's multi-plan refutation engine (`MASTER-PLAN.md:38-39, 175-179`).\n\n**Six North-Star inclusion criteria (every element must serve one)**\n- NS1 UNDERSTAND (diagnose core), NS2 SITUATE (commission researchPrime \"where warranted\"), NS3 ANTICIPATE (Oranges-lens foresight on a single effort), NS4 VETTED FORWARD VALUE (no kill-filter, no hallucination), NS5 ELEVATES not merely critiques, NS6 COMPOSES not reimplements (`MASTER-PLAN.md:24-39`).\n- NS4 is intentionally **cross-cutting** â€” it has no single pillar because it disciplines every forward claim; its done-floor = B-honesty + B-ceiling + bounded-refuter-fan-out (`MASTER-PLAN.md:184-187`).\n\n**Key Shark-Tank R1 outcomes (the v2 changes)**\n- The skill was **decoupled into three increments** so Gandalf v1 ships green *without* the external Phase-0 ledger or the heavy elevation oracle (`MASTER-PLAN.md:3-7, 96-99`).\n  - Increment 1 = committed shippable Gandalf v1 on the existing `agent()` seam, anti-laundering as an honor-system checklist (serves NS1â€“NS4, NS6).\n  - Increment 2 = machine-checked anti-laundering, unblocks only when the Phase-0 commission-id ledger lands (hardens NS4).\n  - Increment 3 = elevation-efficacy proof, staged behind a feasibility gate (the NS5 claim).\n- A **non-additive SITUATE is a HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock event**, never a silent auto-descope of the locked clause 2 (`MASTER-PLAN.md:73-74, 130-133`).\n- The oracle is staged behind a feasibility gate, and **(G, k) are set by a power calc, not asserted** (G â‰ˆ 10pp recall, k â‰ˆ 10 fixtures as starting proposals to be confirmed-or-raised) (`MASTER-PLAN.md:64-72, 146-152`).\n\n**PRINCIPLE-D (the deterministic done-floor)**\n- Foreman's ground-truth gate is the deterministic canary/test suite (`node --test test/*.test.mjs`); **no LLM / cross-family judgment is ever inside the gate** â€” oracle A/B and cross-family judging are advisory artifacts only (`MASTER-PLAN.md:76-94`).\n- Boundary canaries B1â€“B9 + B-honesty + B-ceiling each have a **discriminating negative** (a planted violation that must fail), closing the dive's \"canaries verify shape not truth\" concern; label *truth* is owned by the advisory oracle (`MASTER-PLAN.md:77-88`).\n- A meta-isolation test proves advisory-isolation empirically: with the judge endpoint made unreachable, `node --test` still exits 0 on a conformant fixture (`MASTER-PLAN.md:90-94`).\n\n**Stage-2 implementation structure (Foreman handoff)**\n- Restructured so **every `## Wave N` is autonomously Foreman-gateable** by the deterministic gate; human-feasibility/advisory-A/B/external-ledger steps moved *out* into HALT-gated follow-on increments H1â€“H3 (`IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:5-11, 116-133`).\n- Eight waves: W1 schema+canary harness+frozen constants â†’ W2 diagnose seam â†’ W3 SITUATE-compose â†’ W4 refutation discipline â†’ W5 ANTICIPATE â†’ W6 score/label/synthesis â†’ **W7 = Gandalf v1 committed ship milestone** â†’ W8 elevation-oracle harness CODE = autonomous project-DONE (`IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:35-113, 16-21`).\n- Pre-registration **split**: build-time constants (R=3 refuter budget, firing threshold, depth=1, spawn cap=5) frozen in Wave 1; only (G, k) + ICCâ‰¥0.7 power-calc-set later in H1 (`IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:25-31, 120-124`).\n- H1 feasibility/calibration, H2 A/B advisory verdict, H3 machine-checked anti-laundering are **HALT-gated, never autonomous waves**; each terminates in a recorded BLOCKED/UNPROVEN state if its precondition is unmet (`IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:116-133`).\n\n**Honest dependencies & ship-states**\n- Gandalf depends on the diagnose core (build-ready) + researchPrime (exists) + the Phase-0 SCC ledger (**not built** â€” external precondition P0/H3). It does *not* depend on Jumper (inverted: Jumper later composes the finished Gandalf) (`MASTER-PLAN.md:169-173`).\n- Two unambiguous ship-states: **WITHOUT-ledger** (v1 committed, B2â€²/B7â€² stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle, honor-system) and **WITH-ledger** (Increment 2, B2â€²/B7â€² machine-checked) (`MASTER-PLAN.md:135-138`).\n- Single-family substrate â†’ `cross_model:false`, so the groundedness ceiling is **PROMISING** (GROUNDED requires a cross-family refuter); CBS-5 re-stamped un-mitigable until one is wired (`MASTER-PLAN.md:21, 33-34, 163-167`).\n\nOne note: the title you gave references \"NS4\" and cuts off mid-criterion â€” the full NS4 text is the \"VETTED FORWARD VALUE (no kill-filter, no hallucination)\" clause quoted above (`MASTER-PLAN.md:31-34`).\n\nWant this as a committed artifact (e.g., a `SESSION-SUMMARY.md` under `skills/gandalf/planning/`), or is the inline summary enough?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14247,"cache_read_input_tokens":32443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14247},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26bcfcdb-cbf7-4d47-a307-6cb904837b76","uuid":"e17ab4a3-2182-4564-8ad3-e0311922d5ff","request_